              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda Gross"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thank you Sara for this recipe, I changed it by using Lobster shells, Snow Crab shells, &amp; Shrimp shell. Roasted shells first. Omitted a few of your spices and added a few of my own to make Seafood Stock for a Seafood Soup. I won First Prize for \"The Best Seafood\" Category!",
